+MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F_Text_UnusualSignalBriefing:
+	.string "We chase space here with rockets.\n"
+	.string "But lately, the rocks are the ones\l"
+	.string "talking.\p"
+	.string "Our instruments register a faint\n"
+	.string "signal, geological in origin.\l"
+	.string "It comes from deep in METEOR FALLS.\p"
+	.string "Rocks from space, buried in rocks\n"
+	.string "of our own world…\p"
+	.string "It's beyond us. We're rocket\n"
+	.string "scientists, not rock experts.\p"
+	.string "If only we knew one we could ask!\n"
+	.string "STEVEN, perhaps? He was headed\l"
+	.string "for the falls to study the strata.$"
+
 MossdeepCity_SpaceCenter_1F_Text_DidPokemonComeFromSpace:
